    "description": "<p>This Charm expands upon the technology of the Optical Shroud, diverting Essence through white-jade baffles that dampen the resulting display. With the Aura-Dampening Component installed, motes spent on Stealth and Disguise Charms do not contribute to the Champion's anima banner. The Storyteller should also extend this benefit to any effects from other Charms deemed solely applicable to stealth or disguise purposes. The effects of this Charm may even be extended to all Augmentation use, but doing so adds a onemote surcharge to the activation.</p>",
